    </p><a href="/">← Home</a><pagefind-searchbox></pagefind-searchbox><script type="module" src="/pagefind/pagefind-component-ui.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="/static/pagefind.js"></script><h1 class="instruction-section" data-pagefind-body="1" data-pagefind-weight="10" data-pagefind-sort="title">FMUL (immediate)</h1><p class="insn_subtitle" data-pagefind-body="1">Floating-point multiply by immediate (predicated)</p>
      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">This instruction multiplies each Active floating-point
element of the source vector by an immediate, and destructively
places the results in the corresponding elements of the source vector.
The immediate may take the value +0.5 or +2.0 only.
Inactive elements in the destination vector register remain unmodified.</p>
    
